<Layout title="OAuth 2.0 Grant Types & Flows | AuthMatrix Learn">
  <div class="learn-page">
    <aside class="learn-sidebar">
      <p class="sidebar-label">In this article</p>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="#grant-types">1. What is a Grant Type?</a></li>
        <li><a href="#decision-guide">2. Which Flow Should I Use?</a></li>
        <li><a href="#auth-code">3. Authorization Code Flow ⭐</a></li>
        <li><a href="#pkce">4. PKCE Extension</a></li>
        <li><a href="#client-credentials">5. Client Credentials Flow</a></li>
        <li><a href="#implicit">6. Implicit Flow (Deprecated)</a></li>
        <li><a href="#password">7. Resource Owner Password Flow</a></li>
        <li><a href="#device">8. Device Authorization Flow</a></li>
        <li><a href="#refresh">9. Refresh Tokens</a></li>
